<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-14T00:30:27.221Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:30:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican gang members kidnapped local officials to force the release of a detained associate. The defense minister warned that cartels are increasingly using drones for attacks. The U.S. Treasury sanctioned four individuals and eleven entities linked to a cartel-controlled horse-racing and business network. Cartel groups are stealing U.S. rental cars and trucks, then converting them into heavily armored vehicles for cross-border operations. Six people were killed in Mexico by cyclones, and children were among those killed in flooding from Hurricane Simon and Tropical Storm Rachel remnants, while 37 battle-related deaths occurred in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBuR3R3SFZReE52WVpId0NHc015TnVwdGwySy05d1A3N01zUjhYYTJIUGlwbzQ5UWtzZGRmN2c3TGtPX2l5R3lLUWVTNUlDRUo2MGNKMTlxZEM4Wkc4QXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPOXhDQ3dIbkpmRndpS3NsTFF4SDdIb3Y4QVh2dXEwZDQzME1jRHY4cHlXVmdEV2h3anRMRXB6Uld5YWt0SGxFeklpTl9xdGk1ODJIbUFaYmc4R1M2cWZ1dHNITVVRZzI1N0JCbG43UW83QXJVYjQ5anRnbzFsYTBjcFNTdWt0YWtQeGFJRGNGSTkwUjFvdDJJVVJ4QkRUSkQ4QmdJUG56UC1BWjBIaVk5dmdpTktZcThm?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQRk8tVlAzWjJIVFRsWklIRWVDVVJBU2EzcTlvalNWWTdfUnA4R2tfSHhMaDFmRXBQWFpacTFPcVIwRnZaRHFkV0RDLVI0dTVKQ1dwZzlkeTNUMjNyV2EzVG43WjhqU1ptSVI4alZmOC0zSUJKQUZwbi00WFcxeDQtNWRIV0dfOHJVY1JJczgxUm4xeUo0RDFFTmhpTzg1eENGeWFNLXRhMFN0REI2ZnpGdWMxRUFVOExmYi1jM3RmbDliLTU2a3Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNci1ob0ROR2Rpbjl1c2Utei1fY1pQMFcxNUNSdjlvUTloWFlESE1PaHdCYnc5cW9SX1AyaGw1SmlPVFRTUDRUdXNUYnNNN2tqTVdCdnh6aFRyX1pMYmEtaFJpd0ZHdEVVSVpHS3djOHlhdkpHTDY5WnVBRXo5QUdET1FtU3h0SFFiTlg3cTRxMkF